8. `crates/ql-exec/src/session.rs` — map_function_registry_err.
9. Pre-6.4-1 state for diffing: `git show fdbccb704f7^:crates/ql-exec/src/plan.rs | sed -n '400,540p'` for the old is_aggregate_function body.

