   200	/// First-class per-function metadata (contract §10.2). Built-ins register their
   201	/// true metadata; UDFs register theirs. The `canonical_name` is ASCII-uppercase,
   202	/// matching the parser's canonicalization (`ql-formula-syntax`); collision +
   203	/// invalidation rules are in contract §10.3.
