   229	    /// Drives `BindContext::{Scalar | AggregateArg | ReferenceArg}` at
   230	    /// `ql-exec::plan`. `#[serde(default)]` so v0 wire bytes (6.4-0 era,
   231	    /// before this field existed) deserialize cleanly with the
   232	    /// conservative [`ArgContext::Scalar`] default — matching the
