  1089	    // **W5-RT-2 (RT-V1-01 Step 2)**: reference-aware tier — address-only
  1090	    // batch. ROW / COLUMN return the 1-indexed row/col of a Reference or
  1091	    // Range arg (or of the calling cell if omitted). ROWS / COLUMNS return
