  1473	    // this pass would be invisible to the metadata table and silently
  1474	    // fall back to "unknown function" semantics at the walker, breaking
  1475	    // the contract's "built-ins register their true metadata" promise.
  1476	    //
  1477	    // **Subset invariant (NOT bijection):** the metadata table may carry
  1478	    // extra entries that have no dispatch counterpart — Phase 1 above
  1479	    // explicitly tags RANDARRAY/INDIRECT/OFFSET/INFO/CELL as
  1480	    // Volatile/Dynamic so the dep walker treats them as graph-volatile
