  1483	    // wave). The contract §10.3 unknown-function policy is "graph-
  1484	    // visible and treated Volatile/Dynamic"; encoding that here keeps a
  1485	    // user-typed `=INDIRECT(...)` flagged volatile even before dispatch
  1486	    // ships, matching today's `is_volatile_function` whitelist behavior.
  1487	    //
