  1500	         a `r.register*` call without a matching metadata override here \
  1501	         would silently fall back to unknown-fn semantics in the dep walker. \
  1502	         dispatch={} metadata={}.",
  1503	        r.fns.len(),
  1504	        r.metadata.len(),
