  2268	    /// **Conflict on dup:** registering metadata under a name that
  2269	    /// already has metadata returns `Conflict` — never silent
  2270	    /// override. Mirrors the dispatch table's duplicate-panic rule
  2271	    /// but recoverable (UDF runtime, not boot-time builtin pop).
  2272	    #[test]
  2273	    fn register_metadata_returns_conflict_on_duplicate() {
