  2187	    ///
  2188	    /// **6.4-1 (2026-05-28; I1):** ISREF moved out of `AddressOnly` to
  2189	    /// `DepShape::LazyShape` — the walker now skips its arg subtree
  2190	    /// entirely rather than routing through `walk_plan_for_address_only_deps`.
