  2138	    /// nor address is needed). The address-only shim no longer matches
  2139	    /// ISREF; the new [`is_lazy_shape_reference_fn`] shim takes over for
  2140	    /// the walker's ISREF short-circuit. Both shims preserve the prior
  2141	    /// walker behavior — only the routing now flows through metadata.
