   534	    /// This invariant fills the gap: every range-aware-registered fn
   535	    /// MUST be admitted by `is_aggregate_function`. Some range-aware
   536	    /// fns may legitimately NOT need range args (none currently), so
   537	    /// this is enforced as an allowlist of EXCEPTIONS — fns that are
