  1702	    /// **W5-RT-1 / Step 1.1 (S1-HIGH-C closure):** matcher-only direction
  1703	    /// of the `accepts_special_arg_lists_only_registered_reference_aware`
  1704	    /// invariant — pin the 7 names the binder treats as reference-aware.
  1705	    /// At Step 1 (no fns registered) the registry-side direction is
  1706	    /// trivially satisfied (empty loop); Step 2/3/4 add the registry-side
  1707	    /// assertions (every name in `reg.lookup_reference_aware` is also in
  1708	    /// the matcher).
  1709	    ///
  1710	    /// The matcher-only direction prevents typo drift in this commit:
  1711	    /// future-me adding a name to one place and forgetting the other is
  1712	    /// caught at test time, not at user-facing-failure time.
  1713	    #[test]
  1714	    fn accepts_special_arg_lists_only_registered_reference_aware_matcher_pin() {
